```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization invitations issue --help
Issue an organization invitation

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization invitations issue [OPTIONS] <--principal <PRINCIPAL>|--email <EMAIL>> <ORGANIZATION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug

Options:
      --principal <PRINCIPAL>  Invite an exact active principal ID
      --email <EMAIL>          Invite one email address
      --json                   Print the invitation result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http    Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                   Print help

```
